Subject: [PATCH] Add local preview setup (jekyll serve)

- Gemfile for running the site locally; GitHub Pages ignores it
- .gitignore for the files the local preview generates
- README: how to preview without committing
- Post template: quote the title so colons don't break it

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015sajfvtPmGkb5ceTztqXFY
